**Summary:** FABLE REVIEWER round 11 (Opus 5.5, headless, read only) found 1,072 open PRs, all drafts. 245 had no verdict on their current head: no PR comment naming it, not inside a release train, and not judged in `C:\CE_PLAN`. The burn-down PRs #1404 to #1483 were already judged in the log, and #1484 is the only new burn-down PR. Eight parallel Opus reviewers took the newest 48 and I reviewed #1484 myself. Each PR was checked against C-50 (`claude/rel-20261020d` @ 9c97d36f) and S-38 (`claude/rel-20261017s` @ 9a8e5d4e), with a grep for anything already shipped and a `git merge-tree` check that it still merges. Afterwards I confirmed that all 49 have exactly one round 11 comment naming the live head. The results are log entries 1420 to 1474 in `C:\CE_PLAN\areas\release-v3-colleagues-REVIEWLANE_LOG.md`, pushed as b1705453 with fetch-and-merge and no rebase. They hold the per-PR verdicts, the corrected C-51 and S-39 merge lists, the PRs waiting for fixes, the out list, and the stack parents that still need their own review (#1063, #1069, #1057, #1142, #1208, #1213). 197 older drafts (#1164 and below) are still unreviewed. No bug is marked FIXED, and the plugin checkout is as I found it; I removed the PR refs I had fetched.
